LayoutGrid 43x3

Components:
  [0] input_pin "a" @(0,0) 6x1
  [1] not_gate "n1" @(10,0) 5x3
  [2] not_gate "n2" @(19,0) 5x3
  [3] not_gate "n3" @(28,0) 5x3
  [4] output_pin "out" @(37,0) 6x1

Wires:
  0.out -> 1.in: (5,0) -> (6,0) -> (6,1) -> (10,1)
  1.out -> 2.in: (14,1) -> (15,1) -> (19,1)
  2.out -> 3.in: (23,1) -> (24,1) -> (28,1)
  3.out -> 4.in: (32,1) -> (33,1) -> (33,0) -> (37,0)
